<section class="gift-card-terms" aria-labelledby="gift-card-terms-heading">
  <h2 id="gift-card-terms-heading">Using your gift card</h2>
  <p>Gift cards never expire. Enter your digital gift-card code at checkout for wine tours or charcuterie orders. You can use part of the balance and save the rest for a future order. If your order exceeds the balance, pay the difference at checkout.</p>
  <p>Gift cards are non-refundable and not redeemable for cash.</p>
  <p>Have an outstanding gift certificate from our previous website? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> so we can verify the remaining balance and help you use it.</p>
</section>
